        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Zingbang lunggeimei zion kailuang khou,",
            "Pourui kazeihang tei njan lou,",
            "Rianramei ruina muang kumna zing e.",
            "Ata kanloumeipu bam khon ne.",
            "",
            "He! Nang niu Jerusalem mei nun",
            "Nzian lou mei guai ta muh ri o,",
            "Naomei guai ta tigai lou ngam kan the",
            "Nzian lou mei guaita muh ri o.",
            "",
            "2. Jerusalem namdai rang bang khou tei.",
            "Amuh ram thei ram me tulana .",
            "Phang zao lo Kalvary ching rukhou tei.",
            "Meinun ding khou Poubaomei hou e.",
            "",
            "3. Zaolo, kalvary chingbut guang tang the,",
            "Tabui nung ai guangtang nina cho?",
            "He poubaomei nang guang dat lak na cho,",
            "Nang bam khang mu kalvary tei ye.",
            "",
            "4. Ai rui muhlak khe Poubaomei jisu,",
            "Kalvary thang tei phang zau bamni,",
            "Akhang tei rui khaeng lou mei alung khou,",
            "Ai rui theih mei ngan na muh lak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
